{
  "videoId": "ep-ieEG06qg",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "So the true is this...",
      "start": 0.88,
      "end": 1.68
    },
    {
      "text": "...I was arrested for failure to pay parking tickets.",
      "start": 2,
      "end": 5.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Parking tickets?",
      "start": 5.3,
      "end": 6.92
    },
    {
      "text": "And I ran all the way here from the Polk Station, the police station.",
      "start": 8,
      "end": 11.3
    },
    {
      "text": "What were you doing before you were arrested?",
      "start": 11.4,
      "end": 14.12
    },
    {
      "text": "I was painting my apartment.",
      "start": 14.12,
      "end": 16.419999999999998
    },
    {
      "text": "Is it now?",
      "start": 16.78,
      "end": 18.82
    },
    {
      "text": "I hope so.",
      "start": 19.96,
      "end": 21.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Jay says you're pretty determined.",
      "start": 21.44,
      "end": 23.12
    },
    {
      "text": "He's been waiting outside the front of the building...",
      "start": 23.12,
      "end": 25.82
    },
    {
      "text": "...with some 40-pound gizmo for over a month.",
      "start": 25.82,
      "end": 28.220000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "- He said you're smart.",
      "start": 28.26,
      "end": 31.640000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "- Well, I like to think so.",
      "start": 28.26,
      "end": 31.640000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "- And you want to learn this business",
      "start": 32.04,
      "end": 34.94
    },
    {
      "text": "- Yes, sir, I wanna learn this business.",
      "start": 32.04,
      "end": 34.94
    },
    {
      "text": "Have you already started learning on your own?",
      "start": 35.24,
      "end": 37.28
    },
    {
      "text": "- Jay?",
      "start": 39.48,
      "end": 41.16
    },
    {
      "text": "- Yes, sir.",
      "start": 39.48,
      "end": 41.16
    },
    {
      "text": "How many times have you seen Chris?",
      "start": 41.74,
      "end": 43.62
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know.",
      "start": 44.12,
      "end": 47.019999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "One too many, apparently.",
      "start": 44.12,
      "end": 47.019999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "- Was he ever dressed like this?",
      "start": 47.34,
      "end": 49.72
    },
    {
      "text": "- No.",
      "start": 47.34,
      "end": 49.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Jacket and tie.",
      "start": 49.84,
      "end": 52.32
    },
    {
      "text": "First in your class in school?",
      "start": 53.84,
      "end": 57.04
    },
    {
      "text": "- High school?",
      "start": 57.1,
      "end": 59.54
    },
    {
      "text": "- Yes, sir.",
      "start": 57.1,
      "end": 59.54
    },
    {
      "text": "- How many in the class?",
      "start": 59.54,
      "end": 62.379999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "- Twelve.",
      "start": 59.54,
      "end": 62.379999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "It was a small town.",
      "start": 62.5,
      "end": 63.64
    },
    {
      "text": "- I'll say.",
      "start": 64.86,
      "end": 67.5
    },
    {
      "text": "- But I was also first in my radar class...",
      "start": 64.86,
      "end": 67.5
    },
    {
      "text": "...in the Navy, and that was a class of 20.",
      "start": 67.5,
      "end": 71.53999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Can I say something?",
      "start": 74.16,
      "end": 75.36
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm the type of person...",
      "start": 77.12,
      "end": 78.56
    },
    {
      "text": "...if you ask me a question, and I don't know the answer...",
      "start": 78.98,
      "end": 82.08
    },
    {
      "text": "...I'm gonna tell you that I don't know.",
      "start": 82.48,
      "end": 84.28
    },
    {
      "text": "But I bet you what.",
      "start": 84.64,
      "end": 86.17999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "I know how to find the answer, and I will find the answer.",
      "start": 86.42,
      "end": 91.06
    },
    {
      "text": "Is that fair enough?",
      "start": 92.32,
      "end": 93.99999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "What would you say if a guy walked in for an interview...",
      "start": 98.1,
      "end": 101.88
    },
    {
      "text": "...without a shirt on...",
      "start": 101.88,
      "end": 103.44
    },
    {
      "text": "...and I hired him?",
      "start": 103.92,
      "end": 107.1
    },
    {
      "text": "What would you say?",
      "start": 103.92,
      "end": 107.1
    },
    {
      "text": "He must've had on some really nice pants.",
      "start": 111.28,
      "end": 115.02
    }
  ],
